#: assets/resources/translations/handbook/basic_plant_explanation.tres
msgid "BASIC_PLANT_EXPLANATION"
msgstr ""
"A plant requires [url={\"entry\":\"Water\"}]water[/url] and [url={\"entry\":"
"\"Fertilizer\"}]fertilizer[/url] to grow. If any of those resources is fully "
"depleted, the plant will die slowly.\n"
"If the health drops to 0 the plant is dead and can't be harvested anymore. "
"To prevent this keep your plant watered.\n"
"If a plant is fully grown the fertilizer and water requirement changes, most "
"plants require less resources, some might require more to sustain the fully "
"grown state.\n"
"\n"
"Above each plant there are status indicators if any resource is missing, "
"check out for them. If they start to blink they are close to run out of that "
"resource, act quick now. They look like this."

#: assets/resources/translations/handbook/drops_group.tres
msgid "DROPS_GROUP"
msgstr "Drops"

#: assets/resources/translations/handbook/fertilizer.tres
msgid "FERTILIZER"
msgstr "Fertilizer"

#: assets/resources/translations/handbook/fertilizer_group.tres
msgid "FERTILIZER_GROUP"
msgstr "Fertilizer"

#: assets/resources/translations/handbook/fertilizer_handbook_description.tres
msgid "FERTILIZER_HANDBOOK_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "What is fertilizer used for?"

#: assets/resources/translations/handbook/fertilizer_handbook_text.tres
msgid "FERTILIZER_HANDBOOK_TEXT"
msgstr ""
"Fertilizer ist needed by a plant to [url={\"entry\":\"KeepPlantAlive\"}]keep "
"it alive[/url]. Plants will user fertilizer tog row and die if not enough is "
"available.\n"
"Keep your plant pots always filled with fertilizer.\n"
"\n"
"[b]tip:[/b] If more than fertilizer is added to an pot, the plant might grow "
"faster!"

