#: assets/resources/translations/upgrades/auto_pot_care_upgrade_description.tres
msgid "AUTO_POT_CARE_UPGRADE_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Automatically add some nutrition and water to the pots over time"

#: assets/resources/translations/upgrades/auto_pot_care_upgrade_long_description.tres
msgid "AUTO_POT_CARE_UPGRADE_LONG_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"This upgrade is a combination of the [url={\"entry\":"
"\"WATERING_SYSTEM_UPGRADE_NAME_NONE\"}]watering[/url] and [url={\"entry\":"
"\"RICH_SOIL_UPGRADE_NAME_NONE\"}]rich soil[/url] upgrade.\n"
"The nutrition will also be added if there is a plant in the pot, making this "
"upgrade somewhat stronger."

#: assets/resources/translations/upgrades/auto_pot_care_upgrade_name.tres
msgid "AUTO_POT_CARE_UPGRADE_NAME"
msgstr "Automatic Pot Care"

#: assets/resources/translations/upgrades/end_game_upgrade_description.tres
msgid "END_GAME_UPGRADE_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"A ticket to visit the world, it will stop in all the important cities. I "
"just need enough money for it ..."

#: assets/resources/translations/upgrades/end_game_upgrade_description_long.tres
msgid "END_GAME_UPGRADE_LONG_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"This is the final goal, a ticket to see the world. I need that ticket, I "
"will use the yield created to get enough money."

#: assets/resources/translations/upgrades/end_game_upgrade_name.tres
msgid "END_GAME_UPGRADE_NAME"
msgstr "World Tour Ticket"

#: assets/resources/translations/upgrades/rich_soil_upgrade_description.tres
msgid "RICH_SOIL_UPGRADE_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"Increase the soil quality on each pot, this will increase the nutrition gain "
"if no plant is in the pot."

#: assets/resources/translations/upgrades/rich_soil_upgrade_long_description.tres
msgid "RICH_SOIL_UPGRADE_LONG_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"This upgrade will increase the passive nutrition gain for each pot. A pot "
"does get nutrition automatically if there is no plant in the pot. \n"
"This upgrade will increase the rate of that value."

#: assets/resources/translations/upgrades/rich_soil_upgrade_name.tres
msgid "RICH_SOIL_UPGRADE_NAME"
msgstr "Rich Soil"

#: assets/resources/translations/upgrades/watering_system_upgrade_description.tres
msgid "WATERING_SYSTEM_UPGRADE_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Add a auto watering system to your pots"

#: assets/resources/translations/upgrades/watering_system_upgrade_long_description.tres
msgid "WATERING_SYSTEM_UPGRADE_LONG_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
